{9}{Ever since I was a little girl, I have wanted to study electricity. (She looks down at her feet.) My playmates teased me unmercifly about it. They said I was putting on airs, that a girl could never become a professor, and that I thought I was too good for Shrouded Hills. (She looks back into your eyes) then they would beat me up}{Ever since I was a little girl, I have wanted to study electricity. (She looks down at her feet.) My playmates teased me unmercifly about it. They said I was putting on airs, that a girl could never become a professor, and that I thought I was too good for Shrouded Hills. (She looks back into your eyes) then they would beat me up}{}{}{}{}
